          "_name": "image08",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"image08\" group=\"Image & Video\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reverseContent\" title=\"Reverse\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButton\" title=\"Buttons\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n        <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12\">\n          <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>Art Skills Course</b></h5>\n          <h6 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle, .main-button\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>For ages 9–12</b><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>This class focuses on structured teaching to build a strong foundation in art.</div><div><br></div><div><b>Course includes ：</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>Color Study</b></div><div>Learn color matching and enhance creativity.</div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>Art Design</b></div><div>Combine shapes and ideas to develop composition skills.</div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>Object Observation</b></div><div>Observe real objects to improve detail and expression.</div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>Art Effects</b></div><div>Explore techniques to create rich visual layers.</div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>Painting Study</b></div><div>Learn styles and skills through famous artworks or themes.</div></h6>\n          <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-3  main-button\" mbr-if=\"showButton\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n            <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn More</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-lg-8 side-features\">\n        <div class=\"image-wrapper mb-4\">\n          <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/2-1080x1080.png\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
